# REVIEW-M17 question 3. Line endings are normalised to LF in the repository and checked out with the
# platform ending (CRLF on Windows, where core.autocrlf is true), so every clone agrees. Before this
# file the working copy was 71 CRLF, 77 LF-only and 2 mixed files -- tools writing LF after checkout
# -- and a patch script that assumed one ending matched nothing. Detect per file anyway (CLAUDE.md).
* text=auto
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
